#: 78be7cb4a19e4c9a8293f997c7a260af
msgid "Torch shim"
msgstr "Torch 兼容层"

#: 8bde6f90bd4343d798ec8f86fd50ec16
msgid ""
"The torch shim lets a torch-oriented Python application use Jittor as its "
"runtime. The main Jittor distribution owns only the reusable torch API, "
"deployment, extension build, import-patch, and external-backend mechanisms. "
"Project-specific runtime policy is supplied by optional adapter "
"distributions."
msgstr ""

#: 8033b2eb882c425d8a3f092000bd3e08
msgid "Components"
msgstr ""

#: 4f72dcb17d90451ca62ed10d39a97f5b
msgid ""
"`python/jittor/compat/shim/resources/torch_init.py` is the thin deployed "
"`torch/__init__.py` entry point."
msgstr ""

#: 6e1874bfd5ea4a0e91c44205fbdc0c70
msgid ""
"`resources/stubs/` contains bundled compatibility packages such as "
"`flash_attn`, `torchvision`, `torchaudio`, and `torchdata`."
msgstr ""

#: 11602852c3fa4a4e96e5cd4fd71eea69
msgid ""
"`cpp_extension/` provides the Jittor-backed `torch.utils.cpp_extension` "
"surface used to build source extensions."
msgstr ""

#: 7b914c79c3274679929736fa409554b8
msgid ""
"`runtime.py` implements isolated runtime setup and native extension "
"discovery; `bootstrap.py` is its stable, small public facade."
msgstr ""

#: 7487f04cbbed4f358ca416ba4e86f30f
msgid ""
"`deploy.py` installs the complete shim tree into a target site-packages "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: 9814dbe3786b43b1a5cfa16371e71f04
msgid ""
"The canonical torch-compatible API lives in `jittor.compat.torch`. The shim "
"exports that API under the `torch` module name and wires the submodule paths"
" expected by third-party libraries."
msgstr ""

#: 97d76778dea44f52981159e8ff4f36cb
msgid ""
"`jittor.torch_shim` remains an import-compatible alias of "
"`jittor.compat.shim`; both names resolve to the same module objects."
msgstr ""

#: ccddc491bada42b890c12f728bd37da7
msgid "Bootstrap"
msgstr ""

#: 9771c8addffe45aab32f426882c93d8c
msgid "Applications that need a project-local runtime can enable it explicitly:"
msgstr ""

#: b6138063d46e4cd3903cc872ca115057
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`enable()` creates a runtime below `${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-~/.cache}/jittor"
"/torch-shim/` unless `JITTOR_TORCH_RUNTIME_ROOT` is set. It keeps Jittor, "
"torch extension, CUDA, Triton, pip, and temporary caches below that runtime "
"and deploys the shim into its local site-packages directory."
msgstr ""

#: 421a354fb29b41d48ff415f97c010c31
msgid ""
"Local source extensions are discovered from `setup.py`, `pyproject.toml`, "
"and `CMakeLists.txt` signals. Missing or stale setuptools extensions are "
"rebuilt through the Jittor-backed cpp-extension API. Set "
"`JITTOR_TORCH_SKIP_EXT_BUILD=1` to skip warm-run build checks or pass "
"explicit `extension_dirs` when automatic discovery is not suitable."
msgstr ""

#: fe908d824c4a49d7b104c4cc65775121
msgid ""
"For numerical parity, the bootstrap disables CUDA fast-math contraction for "
"Jittor JIT kernels unless `JITTOR_TORCH_KEEP_FAST_MATH=1` is set. Project "
"extensions retain the flags requested by their own build definitions."
msgstr ""

#: c21252c73a3144c7b82f2fc9df15dca2
msgid "Optional adapters"
msgstr ""

#: 113e65aa53954419bc7c92ece2394dca
msgid "Adapters use two public entry-point groups:"
msgstr ""

#: 4a4d1b137cb14b718e9ce90752764c71
msgid ""
"`jittor.module_patches` registers exact module-path callbacks through "
"`jittor.compat.module_patcher`."
msgstr ""

#: d806ceb717ee43139196991ca89ae063
msgid ""
"`jittor.external_backends` registers extension discovery policy through "
"`jittor.compat.external_backend`."
msgstr ""

#: aee2ea7bf8d54b1189f3b4f840163334
msgid "The maintained adapters are separate distributions:"
msgstr ""

#: 8194b18a544e46f298a12fc93bfeae27
msgid "`jittor-trellis` for TRELLIS.2 runtime policy and kernels."
msgstr ""

#: cdaaf81a9ec148cc81c3beee58376a75
msgid "`jittor-gs` for graphdeco Gaussian Splatting runtime policy and launch tools."
msgstr ""

#: de754e9b7d724170bfad3a3b61ac04ec
msgid "`jittor-hf-compat` for explicitly selected Transformers version adapters."
msgstr ""

#: f1a59cd338ca40b1a71f1b2e4f95e17f
msgid ""
"Installing an adapter makes its entry points discoverable. Applications may "
"also call the adapter's `install()` function explicitly. Jittor itself does "
"not import those projects, inspect their directory layouts, or install "
"permanent project-specific import finders."
msgstr ""

#: 1ddfc0250614477a8ebd3269049c6176
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr ""

#: 65ae50b01b4d4010b7e1ff0cb07d6885
msgid "Deploy the complete shim with the maintained helper:"
msgstr ""

#: 40b1f77be6994f89ae357050297a0d4d
msgid ""
"The target contains the torch package, bundled stubs, and distribution "
"metadata. Do not copy only `resources/torch_init.py`; the nested stub "
"modules and interfaces are part of the runtime contract."
msgstr ""
